  "description": "When the roads turn upward, the Fastlane Premium E-bike is your perfect companion to hold the pace and roll swiftly with that little extra juice that takes the day to that extra level of fun.\n\nAt the heart of the Fastlane is the new TQ HPR40 motor unit that pushes out 40Nm and 290Wh of pedal-assisted acceleration that feels natural, almost more like your legs have found their second wind than a motor has taken control of your ride. On the climbs, the unit delivers the power needed to keep the pace that you’ve set, and on the flats, it gives you the support to get up to 25kmph before disengaging with almost zero drag so pedaling feels unrestricted as if on a non-powered E-Bike.\n\nFastlane is also focused on efficiency with fast tube shapes and a streamlined silhouette. It’s also impressively lightweight at just 10kg for swift handling and a build that won’t sap the battery power like heavier e-bikes would. Shimano’s premium Dura-Ace Di2 gruppo and speed-focused Zipp 353 NSW wheels top off this build and keep you riding fast like a pro.",
